WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.901
-Well, guys, today is
the last day of February,

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.534
so I thought it would be nice to
give a little recap

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:07.367
of the entire month.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:13.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.868
♪ February came and went ♪

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:18.133
♪ The shortest month,
but I feel spent ♪

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.167
♪ 28 days gone so soon ♪

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:21.167
♪ Kind of like... ♪

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:22.601
-The Chinese spy balloon.

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:26.667
-♪ Grammys, BAFTAs, Oscar noms ♪

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:28.834
♪ "Top Gun" did it,
good for Tom ♪

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.701
♪ Whether or not you win
that bling ♪

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:32.567
-♪ Angela Bassett
did the thing ♪

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:35.467
♪ Super Bowl won by the Chiefs ♪

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.400
♪ Eagles fans were
filled with grief ♪

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.467
♪ Rihanna's halftime
we were lovin' ♪

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:41.334
♪ She did it with a... ♪
-Bun in the oven.

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:44.801
♪ Biden gave his big address ♪

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:46.701
♪ State of the Union
in Congress ♪

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:48.667
♪ Republicans shouted
from their chairs ♪

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:49.901
♪ Angrier than a... ♪

00:00:49.901 --> 00:00:50.901
-Cocaine bear.

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:53.968
♪ Valentine's did not go great ♪

00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:56.067
♪ You got stood up
by your date ♪

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:58.934
♪ Tinder tells you that
you should think about... ♪

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:01.200
-Retiring for good.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.300
-♪ Marvel's "Quantumania" ♪

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.334
♪ "Last of Us,"
"Outer Banks-ia" ♪

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:09.167
♪ We watched them all
except our aunts ♪

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.634
♪ Who were drooling over... ♪

00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:12.067
-♪ "Magic Mike, The Last Dance."

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:14.434
-♪ February, you short king ♪

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.334
♪ Here comes March,
it's time for spring ♪

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:18.434
♪ We'll lose money on
our brackets ♪

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:22.834
♪ Then get trashed on
St. Patrick's ♪

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.834
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

